      "target": "Data/Festivals/summer11",
      "key": "Pierre_y2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The moment Lewis steps away from the governor... that's my moment to rub elbows...$0#$e#Ah, I didn't see you there.$4#$e#If you want to buy something, talk to me on the other side of the counter.$1",
      "translation": "Jakmile Lewis odejde od guvernéra... přijde má chvíle navázat kontakty...$0#$e#Ach, nevšiml jsem si tě.$4#$e#Pokud si chceš něco koupit, promluv se mnou na druhé straně pultu.$1",
      "sourceSHA256": "994dfea270b5d62a0a621930fe8e2cafbf3b1e48f9b905db128c67a9d8a789e9",
